        "exercise": "2",
        "text": "How does the internal energy of an ideal gas change during processes $1-1'$ and $1'-2$ in Figure $24$? How does it change during processes $1-2$, $2-3$, and $3-1$ in Figure $30$?"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy9-c1-s3-t9",
        "text": "Input context and full bilingual T9 text locators: /Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-six/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d1816-d135-t9-figures-author/fig-24.input-context.json#/fullText/zh; #/fullText/en; #/fullText/originalZh. Native locators: /Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-six/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d1816-d135-t9-figures-author/contexts/zh/fig-24.native-context.json#/lessons/0/exercises/0; /Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-six/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d1816-d135-t9-figures-author/contexts/en/fig-24.native-context.json#/lessons/0/exercises/0. Draft lesson/exercise source locators and hashes: {\"zh\":{\"exercises\":{\"path\":\"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-six/lemmadeck/.tmp/STEMROBIN-181/d1816-d133/root/9p/editions/modern-us-neutral/lessons/phy9-c1-s3-t9/exercises.json\",\"bytes\":9693,\"sha256\":\"bec822f851de3bfbf578a22a948df758f1a43eaf5210a0b0b164b2314dfcac00\"},\"lesson\":{\"path\":\"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-six/lemmadeck/.tmp/STEMROBIN-181/d1816-d133/root/9p/editions/modern-us-neutral/lessons/phy9-c1-s3-t9/lesson.json\",\"bytes\":980,\"sha256\":\"8322401a0c8171e9b3aa37220da91cc4fcbb7b52ab6207956a46f3fdbc813e84\"},\"fullModernText\":\"1. 大气中哪种分子运动得较快：氢分子或氮分子？\\n\\n2. 在图 $24$ 上过程 $1-1'$ 和 $1'-2$ 中，理想气体的内能如何变化？在图 $30$ 上过程 $1-2$、$2-3$ 和 $3-1$ 中，又怎样变化？\\n\\n3. 在标准大气压和温度为 $20^\\\\circ\\\\mathrm{C}$ 时，体积为 $50$ 米$^3$ 的房间中和盛有 $200$ 厘米$^3$ 水的玻璃杯中，哪里分子较多？\\n\\n4. 当温度从 $37^\\\\circ\\\\mathrm{C}$ 升高到 $40^\\\\circ\\\\mathrm{C}$ 时，我们血液中水分子的均方速度增加百分之几？\\n\\n5. 近代真空泵可以把压强降低到 $1.3\\\\times10^{-10}$ 牛顿/米$^2$≈$10^{-12}$ 毫米高水银柱。在这个压强和温度为 $27^\\\\circ\\\\mathrm{C}$ 时，$1$ 厘米$^3$ 中含有多少气体分子？\\n\\n6. 在压缩机的气缸中，压缩 $4$ 个摩尔的单原子理想气体。试求：如果在一个冲程中做功 $500$ 焦耳，则在这个冲程中气体的温度升高多少？假设过程是绝热的。\"},\"en\":{\"exercises\":{\"path\":\"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-six/lemmadeck/.tmp/STEMROBIN-181/d1816-d133/root/9p/editions/modern-us-neutral-en/lessons/phy9-c1-s3-t9/exercises.json\",\"bytes\":10164,\"sha256\":\"3c08567940807635cf20109906c1f40a7014c86620c111b3b4abaf34822f280a\"},\"lesson\":{\"path\":\"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-six/lemmadeck/.tmp/STEMROBIN-181/d1816-d133/root/9p/editions/modern-us-neutral-en/lessons/phy9-c1-s3-t9/lesson.json\",\"bytes\":985,\"sha256\":\"8230446797809cb75dc8665698776d2723583bfd12f03e096053d59909454201\"},\"fullModernText\":\"1. Which molecules move faster in the atmosphere: hydrogen molecules or nitrogen molecules?\\n\\n2. How does the internal energy of an ideal gas change during processes $1-1'$ and $1'-2$ in Figure $24$? How does it change during processes $1-2$, $2-3$, and $3-1$ in Figure $30$?\\n\\n3. At standard atmospheric pressure and a temperature of $20^\\\\circ\\\\mathrm{C}$, which contains more molecules: the air in a room of volume $50$ m$^3$, or the water in a glass holding $200$ cm$^3$ of water?\\n\\n4. By what percentage does the mean-square speed of water molecules in our blood increase when the temperature rises from $37^\\\\circ\\\\mathrm{C}$ to $40^\\\\circ\\\\mathrm{C}$?\\n\\n5. Modern vacuum pumps can reduce pressure to $1.3\\\\times10^{-10}$ N/m$^2$, approximately $10^{-12}$ mm of mercury. At this pressure and a temperature of $27^\\\\circ\\\\mathrm{C}$, how many gas molecules are contained in $1$ cm$^3$?\\n\\n6. $4$ moles of a monatomic ideal gas are compressed in a compressor cylinder. Find how much the gas temperature rises during one stroke if the work done during that stroke is $500$ J. Assume the process is adiabatic.\"}}. Primary original image: /Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-six/lemmadeck/.tmp/STEMROBIN-181/d1816-d133/root/9p/figures/fig-24.png. Original T9 exercises binding: {\"path\":\"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-six/lemmadeck/.tmp/STEMROBIN-181/d1816-d133/root/9p/lessons/phy9-c1-s3-t9/exercises.json\",\"bytes\":3726,\"sha256\":\"46fe5fa709cb5c0eddbdb8294d910be9df87294888a6c7cb4b41433334519d69\"}. These are unfinalized draft carriers, not course approvals. Parent caption localization is bound only, not re-reviewed."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy9-c1-s2-n17",
        "text": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-six/lemmadeck/ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/9p/lessons/phy9-c1-s2-n17/lesson.json#/prose/6; printed_page=35; source_refs=p0044#2\n现在我们用两种方法使气体从状态 $1$ 过渡到状态 $2$，以便可以利用玻义耳-马略特定律和盖·吕萨克定律。为此，我们把容器放到一个盛有热水（温度为 $T_2$）的大玻璃缸里（图 $23$б）。同时，开始增大气体的体积，使得压强 $p_1$ 保持恒定。经过一定时间，气体达到中间平衡状态 $1'$，其体积为 $V'$，温度为$T_2$。这个过程用图 $24$ 上的直线 $1-1'$ 表示。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy9-c1-s2-n17",
        "text": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-six/lemmadeck/ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/9p/lessons/phy9-c1-s2-n17/lesson.json#/prose/7; printed_page=35; source_refs=p0044#3\n然后，缓慢地减小容器的体积，使气体等温地过渡到终了状态，其压强为 $p_2$，体积为 $V_2$（图 $23$в）。这个过程用图 $24$ 上双曲线上的一段 $1'-2$ 表示。"
      }
    ],
